                            p.mb-0 Graduate Teaching Assistant for the course #[a(href='https://www.cs.stonybrook.edu/students/Graduate-Studies/courses/CSE548', target='_blank', rel='noopener') Analysis of Algorithms (CSE 548)] under the guidance of Prof. Rezaul A. Chowdhury. Responsible for helping students understand course concepts and solve algorithmic problems, while grading assignments and exams.
